    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        278.49578857421875,
        527.4264526367188,
        294.2148132324219
      ],
      "text": "M. tuberculosis  TPTs for an infection with strains presumed to be drug-susceptible can be broadly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        292.971923828125,
        527.450927734375,
        307.4149475097656
      ],
      "text": "categorized into two types: monotherapy with isoniazid for at least 6 months (IPT) and treatment",
